{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1385053-arcadia-annexing-the-land-of-oz","id":1385053,"title":"Arcadia Annexing the Land of Oz","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-01T03:19:04-07:00","id":1385053,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Arcadia Annexing the Land of Oz","content":"<div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Idea popped in my head when thinking about Oz. So what if new waves of Fae started popping up, but they represent magical lands being Annexed by Arcadia, or they are part of Arcadia and as part of a coup/punishment for losing a coup they were banished, as maybe what happened with the Houses that Returned to the Autumn World. So I'm thinking Oz may have been ruled by a Charlatan/Mage and then Usurped by a Sidhe Childling, and then left to war between the 4 great leaders. Bu<span style=\"font-family:inherit\">t then something happens and the denizens are booted to take up the Changeling Way on Earth or die like a Sidhe. So Inanimae wake up, Boggans and Nockers, and Claurichan from Munchkin land, Pookah, and even Winged Monkeys as a kith.</span><br /> </span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Lets say this also happens to Neverland as well with both representing relatively new Nations in the Deep Dreaming but Neverland having a smaller population. This swells the ranks of the Commoners returning to Earth. I've got ideas of a lot of them being from the Inanimae from the Flicker and Doll Empire, but also a Kith I have in my home games called Electric Shadow which represent Movie Archetypes, so the Pirates would have some of the Swashbucklers.<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">But then we get Avalon which returns a number of Nobles to Earth, as well as their attending host. What would be optimal spacing if I said this started sometime after the New Millenium? Like maybe four years Between Oz and Neverland, and then say have Avalon be really recent?<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Part of what I'm thinking is for a story like this the secret is maybe an expansion/consolidation/tumult of power in the Deep Dreaming, combined with the idea that that if they Exile the losers the Exiling Hosts have to send the Mortal souls back into the Deep Dreaming to become new Fae as just a basic part of how the Magic works. What other ideas do you have to go along with this? One possible route is the War between the Tuatha and the Fomorians in the Dreaming results in things like the homes of the Gods being seized so Olympus or Takamagahara is over thrown, sending potent new changelings. Or the Dreaming Reclaims the Arcadian Gateway and the Emanations are reborn as a wave of new fae on Earth. What about the idea of different houses showing up than we already have representing fallen regimes of the different lands?<br /> <br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#1C1E21\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Oh one of the Annexed Lands I could see as interesting could be Hell or Purgatory to get Imps, Devils, Succubi, Oni, Dullahans, Furies, ect kiths.</span></span></span></div></span><br /> </span></span></span></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T04:43:35-07:00","id":1385058,"title":"","content":"Would they be Houses or kiths?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T05:53:13-07:00","id":1385064,"title":"","content":"Beau Brown had a great Changeling Oz site going (which he is revisiting for C20). In it Oz had been conquered by King Ironheart and is presently under the control of the Nome King (a cruel Glome). I always loved the idea of Oz being a realm, and prone to dynastic fluctuations.<br /> <br /> Remember that Oz is only a part of the larger realm of Nonestica, so there is a great deal to draw from. This could easily be a reference to realms deeper in the Dreaming, part of Hy Brazil and other domains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":1756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","user":"MythAdvocate","date":". 05-01-2020, 08:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T01:21:19-07:00","id":1385213,"title":"","content":"I remember that Changeling Oz site and it was great! I heard he had more that he didn't put on the webpage. But I had no idea he is revisiting it for C20, that is cool!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T01:35:24-07:00","id":1385214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1385053-arcadia-annexing-the-land-of-oz?p=1385058#post1385058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would they be Houses or kiths?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Winged Monkeys would be a Kith alien to Earth, and Wonderland and Earth might just use Bannerhouses instead. But they could have just a brand new house in Oz to represent their limited contact with Earth. Maybe they could have a house Ozma. I like the idea that their could have been travel between Oz and Neverland, and the Legendary Realm, and Hybrasil, and the Arcadian Gateway. :P<br /> <br /> And Avalon would fit just having normal houses since its tied to Western Europe, but I like ideas like the ideas of minor houses, I know now we have banner houses but this isn't official so I feel free to toss in Minor Houses, like House <b>Nimu\u00eb.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> But Fomorians and Tuatha Warring again in the Dreaming would be a good way to bring their war to the attention of the Autumn world. It could be like a reverse Shattering, where the lesser fae are fleeing to Earth whenever their homeland is conquered. Combined with the idea that Mortals are abducted to be made into new changelings in the Dreaming and its a pretty good foundation for doing an End Times chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T09:43:16-07:00","id":1385257,"title":"","content":"In that regard, you might want to look at the <i>Fables</i> comic book series for more inspiration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T13:19:37-07:00","id":1385293,"title":"","content":"What House/kith would you make Ozma? And how old is her Seeming supposed to be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T23:11:41-07:00","id":1385357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1385053-arcadia-annexing-the-land-of-oz?p=1385293#post1385293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What House/kith would you make Ozma? And how old is her Seeming supposed to be?</div> </div> </div> </div>A Sidhe Princess and either the Founder of House Ozma or one of the last few members of a lost House of Ozma.<br /> <br /> Or Maybe if she is from one of the Normal houses then Gwydion would fit her nobility and purity. But it could be interesting that since virtually all of Liam stayed on Earth maybe the few Liam that went into the Dreaming broke into fragmented new Houses.<br /> <br /> Wonderland would fit the triumvirate of literary Wonderlands, as would Narnia but I still need to read the whole series. :P<br /> <br /> <br /> But perhaps Avalon was Annexed or Coup d'\u00e9tat'ed in 1969 and from Avalon came the first wave of the Sidhe host!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T12:51:28-07:00","id":1386464,"title":"","content":"Rough outline for a Winged Monkey Kith. Their revelry involves prancing for glamour. Their Birthright are Wonderful Wings of Oz allowing them to fly, and for the 2nd I\u2019m divide, it might be a pack tactics bonus, or maybe when wearing their hats makes playing tricks easier. Their flaw would be curse of the Golden Cap where if someone steals their Cap it\u2019s much like knowing their true name or having a Selkie Coat, and even if a mortal wears it they can compel orders from the Winged Monkey.<br /> <br /> Thoughts? I might have their caps be what ties them to the Mortal realm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T13:44:26-07:00","id":1386473,"title":"","content":"Hmm I might make the second Birthright Jungle Japery. Where Flying Monkey gets an attribute plus one to represent different primate body types, or a bigger boost but only when prancing or following orders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}